╭─ Clone web-shop on vps ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ vps clones it from the URL, then copies the git-ignored files you tick (such as .env) into the clone. Ignored    │
│ folders, such as node_modules, are never offered.                                                                │
│                                                                                                                  │
│ from    https://github.com/acme/web-shop.git                                                                     │
│ into    ~/code/web-shop                                                                                          │
│                                                                                                                  │
│ files to copy into the clone                                                                                     │
│ [ ] .env  5 B                                                                                                    │
│ [ ] local.toml  8 B                                                                                              │
│                                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                                  │
│ a click on a file ticks it · only ticked files are copied · enter clones · esc goes back                         │
│                                                                                       back   skip files   clone  │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
